  "citation": "Raj, P.K. and Atallah, S. (1974), AGA tests, reported in: Raj, P.K. (2005). Large LNG Fire Thermal Radiation - Modeling Issues & Hazard Criteria Revisited. Process Safety Progress 24(3), 192-202. Table 1, 'Summary of LNG Fire Experiments'.",
